**Troubleshooting test failures**

It looks like the test failed because the Column widget in my setup has an unconstrained height, which is causing infinite height issues. Our existing tests ran fine because they were placed directly in the Scaffold body. To fix this, I can use an Expanded widget or set a specific height with a SizedBox. 

I’m also noticing that the line in the test expectation might not align with when the focusNode.requestFocus executes. I need to keep track of the line numbers. It seems I'm dealing with focus management issues here, which could lead to cascading exceptions in the test.
